          "date": "2026-08-24 05:44:01.000000000",
          "tz": -240
        },
        "subject": "LU-19744 doc: document the llapi_ioctl(3) return contract",
        "message": "LU-19744 doc: document the llapi_ioctl(3) return contract\n\nllapi_ioctl(3) said the function returns 0 on success and a negative\nvalue on failure, but it returns the ioctl(2) result directly, so a\nfailure is -1 with errno set. The one exception is a negative fd,\nwhich returns -EBADF and sets errno to match.\n\nSigned-off-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:Opus-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I18f941ebc492f7986d13175166b2a5e952d63671\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
